{# narrative_engine/probe — one question of the decision API probe.
   Sent once per question and order by the Plots tab's "Probe decisions"
   button; DecisionProbe logs what came back. Not part of any feature.
   Receives: sentence, question,
     options [{ key, text }] — keys c1 onward: every run of consecutive
     words in the sentence, and one saying the sentence does not name it.
   NOTE: no fenced blocks and no literal braces anywhere in this file. #}
[ state sentence ]
{{ sentence }}
[ end state ]

[ question pick choice ]
{{ question }} Choose the words of the sentence that answer it: all of the words that name the answer, and no others. If the sentence does not say, choose that it is not named.
[ criteria ]
{% for o in options %}{{ o.key }}: {{ o.text }}
{% endfor %}[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
